Copy a local directory into a sandbox. In a git repository, only the files git tracks or does not ignore

Usage: boat push [OPTIONS] <ID> <DIR>

Arguments:
  <ID>   Sandbox ID, or "current".
  <DIR>  Local directory to copy.

Options:
      --api-url <API_URL>  [env: BOAT_API_URL=]
      --to <PATH>          Directory on the sandbox. Default: /home/user/<dir name>.
      --org <ID_OR_NAME>   Run this command in an organization's billing scope. See `boat org list`. [env: BOAT_ORG=]
      --json               Force machine-readable JSON/JSONL output
      --no-update          Skip the automatic CLI update (also BOAT_NO_UPDATE=1) [env: BOAT_NO_UPDATE=]
  -h, --help               Print help
